= The season in short

The society's forty-one plots stayed *fully let* all year, and the
waiting list grew to nineteen names. This report covers the spring
sowing, the summer watering rota, and the state of the shared tool
shed at the end of October.

The headline figures:

- 41 plots, all let, 19 people waiting
- 635 seedlings raised in the communal greenhouse
- 3 working parties held, averaging 14 volunteers each

= Seedlings from the greenhouse

The greenhouse team raised bedding plants for members to buy at cost.
Monthly totals are shown in @fig-seedlings. May was the peak month,
as it is every year, and the team has asked for a second cold frame
before next spring.

